      "filename": "StateLibQld 2 201211 Observatory, Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, Queensland, ca. 1908.jpg",
      "title": "File:StateLibQld 2 201211 Observatory, Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, Queensland, ca. 1908.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/StateLibQld_2_201211_Observatory%2C_Wickham_Terrace%2C_Brisbane%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1908.jpg",
